<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικλείω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extol</i> or <i>praise the more</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γὰρ ἀοιδὴν μᾶλλον ἐπικλείουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.351
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>relate</i> or <i>recount that . . </i>, c. acc. et
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>call,
				name</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόν ῥ᾽ ἄνδρες ἐ. Βοώτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					92
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1156
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <i>call
				upon, invoke</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλωνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.700
				</span></i>
			: c.inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυθέρειαν ἐ. ἀμύνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.553
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
